blocks.en:
No prior work characterizes the closed form’s adequacy on natural broadband scenes, states the
chromatic-adaptation requirement, or treats the primary-model ambiguity in the scotopic weights;
the present note supplies all three.

blocks.zh:
任何先前的工作都没有说明封闭式表格在自然宽带场景上的适足性。
色调适应要求,或处理相位加权中的主要模型模糊;
本说明提供了所有三项。
